"Khaton incarnated in Mornyr through the corpse of Oleander, Maranor's fallen champion."
"Maranor tried to devour dead Khaton's might at Mornyr, and was tainted by it."
"The god Gomogog also died in Mornyr, slain by Viv as the first avatar of Enttiku."
"Viv, weakened, flew home from Mornyr aboard Solfis and forgot the stranded cavalry and refugees."
